{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《香港小姐2026競選決賽》今晚（8月30日）假將軍澳電視城舉行。八強出爐後，「6號」陸浩明率一眾主持訪問師姐馮盈盈、黃嘉雯、陳懿德，向今晚佳麗作出鼓勵。惟坐在三人後面的郭珮文（Juliana）今晚以低胸裝上陣，難掩出眾身材，有網民指畫面太過養眼，根本無法專心聽前面三人說話。</p><figure><img alt=\"Juliana坐馮盈盈後面。（TVB截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170853743118651392163758.png/kI9rnPZXmSbUftXIDTy-8AFrDZy1oVujLd55iC3eeYg\"/><figcaption>Juliana坐馮盈盈後面。（TVB截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"身材出眾。（TVB截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170853740463525888306879.png/QUKWl7T5EG0yxDoVMNEvVuho7N6OwQ5z8yBT7vMgU-4\"/><figcaption>身材出眾。（TVB截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"低胸。（TVB截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170853737644822528685702.png/zlQ08DkqVcsmS59aeTdkFvEL31aBS3qBdksmNXZLJjU\"/><figcaption>低胸。（TVB截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好養眼。（TVB截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170853734910005248298364.png/V096_DE7vYcPEq0o05hpHyuCrQGv6LnG1FpoPtRaaD4\"/><figcaption>好養眼。（TVB截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T14:18:32.185654+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":4,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}